record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010210805:1":{"text":"ああ、臭いは酷いが、危険は無かった。フランツが盗賊と結託している可能性が出てきたが、あれだけでは証拠にならない。","source_cn":"嗯，洞里虽然味道大了点，但没有危险。弗朗茨和盗匪可能有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC65356F7EB204E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010210806:1":{"text":"なるほど。どうりでフランツ荘園の管理人が、あんなに自信満々だったわけだ……","source_cn":"原来如此，怪不得此前弗朗茨庄园的管事曾经向我保证过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC9A5CCFCA49B04F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010210807:1":{"text":"言われたんだよ。もしウィステリア・クリスタルの取引をするなら、販路は絶対に問題ない、橋の故障や火事も二度と起こさせないと保証するってね。","source_cn":"他说，如果我考虑和弗朗茨合作，收购藤水晶，那么商路绝对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9E50B7958796857","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010210808:1":{"text":"そういえば、もう一つ思い出したんだけど……北村の麦の生産量が、寒さのせいで落ちてるのは知ってるよね。","source_cn":"说到这个，我想起另一件事……你们大概知道，北村麦子的产...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB2F299013074E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010210809:1":{"text":"でも、ブドウって麦よりも寒さに弱いんだ。だから、南村のウィステリア・クリスタルの方が、もっと生産量が下がるはずなんだよ。","source_cn":"然而，葡萄的耐寒程度比麦子更差，南村藤水晶的产量应该跌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80B21C25E8763CF8","variant_status":"","mal